From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 02:15:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add post-routing task tagging pipeline

Off-path sidecar module: non-blocking TagQueue, Tagger trait for the separate
task classifier, bounded-concurrency workers, JSONL writer joinable to
routing_capture.jsonl on request_id. no_match and untagged are distinct result
statuses; untagged carries a reason (timeout, error, dropped, sampled_out).
TagInput carries no route fields. Not yet wired into service.rs.
